-- title:
--   Properness of a↦σ(a)a⁻¹ above a finite place
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ and $L$ be number fields with $L$ a finite Galois extension of $K$ (the typeclass hypotheses record that $L$ is a $K$-algebra, finite-dimensional over $K$, and Galois), let $\sigma : L \simeq_{\mathrm{alg}[K]} L$ be a $K$-automorphism of $L$, and assume that every $\tau \in \mathrm{Gal}(L/K)$ lies in the subgroup of integer powers of $\sigma$, so that the Galois group is cyclic and generated by $\sigma$. Let $v$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_K$, with completion $K_v$, and write $E = L \otimes_K K_v$. Let $C$ be a compact subset of the unit group $E^\times$. The assertion is that there exists a compact subset $C' \subseteq E^\times$ with the following property: for every unit $a \in E^\times$ such that the image of $a$ under the unit-group map induced by $\sigma \otimes \mathrm{id}_{K_v}$ (the ring endomorphism [`AutomorphicForm.sigmaTensor`](def/AutomorphicForm_TwistedOrbital.html#L199) of $L \otimes_K K_v$, namely $\sigma$ on the left factor and the identity on $K_v$), multiplied by $a^{-1}$, lies in $C$, there is a unit $p \in K_v^\times$ with $\iota(p)\, a \in C'$, where $\iota$ is the map on unit groups induced by the right inclusion $K_v \to L \otimes_K K_v$, $x \mapsto 1 \otimes x$.
--
--   This is the local, $p$-adic properness statement accompanying Hilbert's Satz 90 for the cyclic extension $L/K$ completed at $v$: the twisting map $a \mapsto \sigma(a)a^{-1}$ on $(L\otimes_K K_v)^\times$, whose kernel is the image of $K_v^\times$, is proper modulo that kernel, so preimages of compacta are compact up to translation by $\iota(K_v^\times)$. It is used in the construction of a torus section in [`AutomorphicForm.exists_torusSection_forall_normString_diagUnits2_eq`](thm.html#AutomorphicForm.exists_torusSection_forall_normString_diagUnits2_eq), and its proof combines surjectivity of the twisting map onto norm-one elements with the finiteness of the set of twisting classes meeting a compact open subgroup.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AutomorphicForm_exists_isCompact_forall_exists_includeRight_mul_mem_of_sigmaTensor_mul_inv_mem_adicCompletion.lean

